        "text": "The speaker identifies as a conservative.",
        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes in free markets and free competition.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Free competition should be open to new businesses and new entrants.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Free competition should protect the rights of working people.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Free competition ultimately benefits the American people as a whole.",
