  {
    "episode_id": 95591,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/5/95591.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "I want to ask you about a couple of critics that you've had recently in the media. First, I'll take the unserious one, which comes, of course, from the New York Times, which asked basically your prom date and your middle school principal, who's a self-identified socialist, why they don't like you anymore. I wondered what your response was to that article.",
