        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Government intervention via regulation is less effective than market-based competition.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views 'woke capitalism' as a coordinated effort to consolidate power under elite control.",
        "confidence": 0.83
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a moral problem with allowing corporations to wield disproportionate influence over policy.",
        "confidence": 0.82
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that restoring historical antitrust principles will lead to more equitable outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.8
      },
      {
        "text": "Audience members share skepticism about current regulatory systems and value free-market solutions.",
