        "text": "The speaker believes that political rhetoric influences international relations outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker assumes that the public's awareness shapes government policy direction.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker holds that past administrations' actions constrain current policy options.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker considers the use of 'concentration camps' as a legitimate descriptor of Chinese practices.",
